cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Banded Parallel Greedy-Edge: reproduction package"
message: "If you use this software or its measurements, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Asil
    given-names: Ufuk
    affiliation: "Ostim Technical University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ufukasia/sneakpath-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Code, instances and measurements for a study on frame selection and spatial
  partitioning in multi-vehicle routing over grid-structured fields. Contains
  the method catalogue, the benchmark runner, two dashboards and 111 result
  files covering the Waterloo VLSI and TSPLIB collections.
keywords:
  - travelling salesman problem
  - min-max multiple TSP
  - makespan
  - spatial partitioning
  - greedy edge
  - VLSI
license: MIT
